@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 生成文案、图片与语音内容包
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content/packages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "Spring AI 2.0 如何统一编排多种模型",
  "audience": "Java 开发者",
  "style": "professional"
}

### 非法风格返回中文 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content/packages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "测试",
  "audience": "开发者",
  "style": "imitate-living-artist"
}
